om/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2025/10/26/WVB05251.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia faces Wheeling in an exhibition on Sunday, Oct. 26, at Hope Coliseum in Morgantown, W.Va.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2025/10/26/WVB05251.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:00:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>3</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59615</s:story_id></item><item><title>WVU Launches Gold Rush Returns Ticket Program</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/30/mens-basketball-wvu-launches-gold-rush-returns-ticket-program</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/30/mens-basketball-wvu-launches-gold-rush-returns-ticket-program</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt=" Gold Rush Returns Ticket Program" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.Va. – The Mountaineer Ticket Office in conjunction with the Mountaineer Athletic Club (MAC) is launching a new program to help season ticket holders put their extra tickets in the hands of fellow Mountaineers as part of Gold Rush Returns ticket program. This program will be exclusive to lower-level men's basketball (Courtside, padded seats, and 100-level) and baseball season tickets holders.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg"><media:title> Gold Rush Returns Ticket Program</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/30/Gold_Rush_Returns_Ticket_Program.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 08:49:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59614</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Defeat Coastal Carolina for Fourth Consecutive Victory</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-coastal-carolina-for-fourth-consecutive-victory</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/29/mens-soccer-mountaineers-defeat-coastal-carolina-for-fourth-consecutive-victory</guid><category>Men's Soccer</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="Julen Recalde celebrates after scoring a goal against Coastal Carolina" src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" /><br /><br />MORGANTOWN, W.VA. (Oct. 29, 2026) – The No. 13 West Virginia University men's soccer team picked up its fourth straight victory with a 2-0 win over Coastal Carolina, Thursday evening at Dick Dlesk Soccer Stadium. The Mountaineers improve to 9-2-4 and 5-1-2 in the Sun Belt while the Chanticleers fall to 5-6-4 and 3-3-2 in conference play.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg"><media:title>Julen Recalde celebrates after scoring a goal against Coastal Carolina</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/10/29/msoc_vs_coastal-4.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:45:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>6</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59613</s:story_id></item></channel></rss>